{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39824","headline":"鹦鹉 · 殷文圭","name":"鹦鹉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹觜如簧翠羽轻，随人呼物旋知名。\n金笼夜黯山西梦，玉枕晓憎帘外声。\n才子爱奇吟不足，美人怜尔绣初成。\n应缘是我邯郸客，相顾咬咬别有情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}